\end{align*}



\noindent can be used to characterize prospective Quantum advantage, specifically as to whether the probability of Alice and Bob performing error correction, and authentication, is extremely likely, from the set of conditions,


\[
\left\{\!\begin{array}{ll@{}>{{}}l} 
