Let $\varphi_1$ be the eigenvector corresponding to the first eigenvalue $\lambda_{1,0,0}$ with $\norm{\varphi_1}^2_2=\mu$. Then, since $\Psi(t\varphi_1) \geq 0$ for all $t \geq  0$, we conclude
$$
