Fix $M>0$ and assume that $\|A^{(t)}\|_\infty \leq M$ throughout the training for all $t=1,...,T+1$. Then for all $j=1,...,W$, we have
\[
\left|\left[B^{(t)}A^{(t)}\right]_{ij} \right|
=
\left|\sum_{k=1}^r B^{(t)}_{ik} A^{(t)}_{kj}\right|
\leq
M \left|\sum_{k=1}^r B^{(t)}_{ik}\right|.
