To bound the term (\ref{t:ERC}) in Eq. (\ref{eq:Rademacher_Bound}), we apply~\cite[Proposition 5.17]{Wainwright_2019_HDStat} to obtain:
\[
            \hat{\mathrm{R}}(\Lambda\circ \mathcal{F})
     \le 
    \inf_{t\in [0,c^{\star}/2]}\, 
        4t
    + 
