        x^{(1)}
.
\end{align}
where the right-hand inequality held by definition of $A^{(t)}$ in~\eqref{eq:lower_bound_weighting} (assuming that $B^{(t)}$ has \textit{full rank}).

Iterating the above argument and appealing to the recursive representation of $\hat{f}$ in~\eqref{eq:LoRA}, we deduce that
\[
    \hat{f}(x) = x
