      \field{abstract}{Given an arrangement of subtori of arbitrary codimension in a complex torus, we compute the cohomology groups of the complement. Then, by using the Leray spectral sequence, we describe the multiplicative structure on the associated graded cohomology. We also provide a differential model for the cohomology ring, by considering a toric wonderful model and its Morgan algebra. Finally, we focus on the divisorial case, proving a new presentation for the cohomology of toric arrangements.}
