The difference between the initial bilayer and 1.6~$\mu$M PXG is larger than seen with subsequent addition of 3.2~$\mu$M PXG (Figure~\ref{fgr:NR_MscL_bilayer_3p2_PXG}), though some differences are observed with the increased PXG concentration at high $Q$. A comparison of the best fit parameters for the bilayer and MscL protrusion are shown in Table~\ref{tbl:bil_PXG}. The parameters corresponding to solid layers were constrained to the values corresponding to the best fit to the tether data (Table~S1). 

